{"parentUuid":"b7d09b11-f33a-4534-b365-e95b5664ad53","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01HvGv1snKj5coV547fgzdZQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PADa81CFS5MShHUVtarvca","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo\\server\\router\\AGENTS.md","old_string":"1. API preflight handling\n2. `/api/proxy`\n3. `/api/<endpoint>`\n4. `/mod/...`\n5. `/~/...` and `/L0/...`, `/L1/...`, `/L2/...`\n6. page shells and page actions","new_string":"1. API preflight handling\n2. `/api/proxy`\n3. `/api/agent-runtime/...` → Benny runtime, AGENT facade (sandbox-bound key + forced scope)\n4. `/api/runtime/...` → Benny runtime, HUMAN facade (trusted key, client scope stripped)\n5. `/api/memoray/...` → Memo-Ray memory-graph proxy\n6. `/api/<endpoint>`\n7. `/mod/...`\n8. `/~/...` and `/L0/...`, `/L1/...`, `/L2/...`\n9. page shells and page actions\n\nThe agent facade is matched **before** the human facade so its prefix can never be shadowed. Scope is bound to the credential the proxy injects (see `server/lib/runtime_proxy.js`), never to a client header — that is the ADR-001 confused-deputy fix."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1082,"cache_read_input_tokens":184268,"output_tokens":638,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1082,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":638,"cache_read_input_tokens":184268,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1082,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1082},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcMm8BwAzdEsvmB3Vdvse","type":"assistant","uuid":"bc946888-e93c-447a-9e04-f7